Starting with $u_1^*=-X_0/(N+1)$ and repeatedly substituting
$X_j=X_{j-1}+u_j^*+\xi_j$ gives by induction
$$
X_{n-1}=\frac{N-n+2}{N+1}X_0
+\sum_{j=1}^{n-1}\frac{N-n+2}{N-j+1}\xi_j.
